                        <div class="product-layout-info col-md-6 col-sm-12">
                            <div class="container">
                                <div class="product-wrapper-info">
                                    <h1 class="product-title float-start w-100" itemprop="name">
                                        MPS 250 S4                                                                                        <span class="h3 product-subtitle">
                                                    Subwoofer Driver <span class='product-subtitle-separator'>|</span> 1000 W Peak Power <span class='product-subtitle-separator'>|</span> 250 mm <span class='product-subtitle-separator'>|</span> Grille included                                                </span>
                                                                                    </h1>
                                    <div class="product-block product-description float-start w-100">
                                        <input type="checkbox" id="expanded">
                                        <div class="product-description-paragraph" itemprop="description">
                                            <p>Mille PRO shallow subwoofers have been meticulously designed to deliver exceptional performance even in situations where space is extremely limited for installing a subwoofer box.<br><br>The MPS 250 S4 is specifically optimized to excel in ultra-compact sealed boxes, starting from a mere 14 liters (0.49 cubic feet). A prime example of its application would be in subwoofer enclosures placed under the rear bench of pickup trucks, where space and height constraints are significant challenges.<br><br>The Mille PRO subwoofer sets a new standard with its depth/performance ratio, which has never been achieved before, thanks to an impressive 20% increase in cone excursion capacity compared to traditional designs.<br><br>This remarkable achievement is made possible by an ingenious suspension group design featuring a dedicated support structure for the spider and coil. This innovative solution allows the magnetic group to be positioned inwards, reducing the depth while maximizing the cone's linear excursion.<br><br>Key Features:<br>1. Ultra-shallow overall depth<br>2. 500W continuous power handling<br>3. Optimized for extremely-compact sealed enclosures of 12-14 liters (0.4-0.5 cubic feet)<br>4. Air Intercooling Revolution (A.I.R.) prevents air-compression-related limitations<br>5. Unrivalled mechanical excursion, +20% over traditional designs<br>6. Six-layer copper voice coil (38mm/1.5 in.) ensures high thermal capacity<br>7. Non-vented rear design allows for reduced enclosure depth<br>8. Robust screw-less mesh grille included, with black screws provided<br>9. Die-cast aluminum frame<br>10. Solid horizontal 8AWG spring-loaded terminals<br>11. EID: Scan, Discover, Identify<br></p>                                        </div>
                                        <label for="expanded" role="button"></label>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="product-block product-btn-actions float-start w-100 d-flex align-items-center">
