				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d97438a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="d97438a" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<h4><b>Mille PRO shallow subwoofers have been designed to achieve exceptional performance even when there is very little space available to install the subwoofer box.</b></h4>								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-346f8d2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="346f8d2" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>The subwoofers are optimized to work in <b>ultra-compact sealed boxes</b> starting from only 14 Lt (0.49 Cf) for 10&#8242; models (MPS 250) and 22,7 (0.8 Cf) for 12&#8217;models (MPS 300). A typical example is a subwoofer enclosure under the rear bench of pickup trucks, where the space &#8211; and the height &#8211; are limited.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f28d764 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="f28d764" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>The new MPS (Mille PRO Shallow) subwoofers have a depth/performance ratio never achieved before thanks to the <strong>impressive cone excursion capacity</strong> which is 20% higher than a traditional design.</p>								</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</div>
					</div>
		</section>
				<section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-d9306f9 container elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-invisible" data-id="d9306f9" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section" data-settings="{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;slideInRight&quot;}">
						<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default">
					<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-06a0c90" data-id="06a0c90" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9e1bef9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="9e1bef9" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
																<a href="https://static.hertz-audio.com/media/2021/09/HERTZ_MPS250_SPACCATO_prova-03_pp.jpg" data-elementor-open-lightbox="yes" data-elementor-lightbox-title="HERTZ_MPS250_SPACCATO_prova-03_pp" data-e-action-hash="#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6IjYxMTIiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczpcL1wvc3RhdGljLmhlcnR6LWF1ZGlvLmNvbVwvbWVkaWFcLzIwMjFcLzA5XC9IRVJUWl9NUFMyNTBfU1BBQ0NBVE9fcHJvdmEtMDNfcHAuanBnIn0%3D">
