				<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-014a332" data-id="014a332" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<section class="elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-fe9bc91 elementor-section-content-middle elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="fe9bc91" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section">
						<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default">
					<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-295c1ee" data-id="295c1ee" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6ecdc32 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="6ecdc32" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
																<a href="https://static.hertz-audio.com/media/2021/10/Hertz_Mille_PRO_MPS_250_PROSP-e1635580175504.jpg" data-elementor-open-lightbox="yes" data-elementor-lightbox-title="Hertz_Mille_PRO_MPS_250_PROSP" data-e-action-hash="#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6IjY3MzEiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczpcL1wvc3RhdGljLmhlcnR6LWF1ZGlvLmNvbVwvbWVkaWFcLzIwMjFcLzEwXC9IZXJ0el9NaWxsZV9QUk9fTVBTXzI1MF9QUk9TUC1lMTYzNTU4MDE3NTUwNC5qcGcifQ%3D%3D">
							<img width="300" height="260" src="https://static.hertz-audio.com/media/2021/10/Hertz_Mille_PRO_MPS_250_PROSP-e1635580175504-300x260.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium wp-image-6731" alt="" srcset="https://static.hertz-audio.com/media/2021/10/Hertz_Mille_PRO_MPS_250_PROSP-e1635580175504-300x260.jpg 300w, https://static.hertz-audio.com/media/2021/10/Hertz_Mille_PRO_MPS_250_PROSP-e1635580175504-1024x886.jpg 1024w, https://static.hertz-audio.com/media/2021/10/Hertz_Mille_PRO_MPS_250_PROSP-e1635580175504-768x665.jpg 768w, https://static.hertz-audio.com/media/2021/10/Hertz_Mille_PRO_MPS_250_PROSP-e1635580175504.jpg 1248w" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" />								</a>
															</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8b95337 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="8b95337" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>This exceptional target has been achieved thanks to the <strong>smart suspension group design</strong> featuring a dedicated support structure for spider and coil. This solution has allowed to move the magnetic group inwards, reducing the depth and at the same time <strong>maximizing cone linear excursion</strong>.</p>								</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</div>
					</div>
		</section>
					</div>
		</div>
					</div>
		</section>
				<section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-45db954 container elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-invisible" data-id="45db954" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section" data-settings="{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;slideInLeft&quot;}">
						<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default">
					<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-d358d0e" data-id="d358d0e" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3948a74 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="3948a74" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
															<img width="300" height="63" src="https://static.hertz-audio.com/media/2021/10/Hertz_AIR-300x63.png" class="attachment-medium size-medium wp-image-6729" alt="" srcset="https://static.hertz-audio.com/media/2021/10/Hertz_AIR-300x63.png 300w, https://static.hertz-audio.com/media/2021/10/Hertz_AIR-1024x215.png 1024w, https://static.hertz-audio.com/media/2021/10/Hertz_AIR-768x161.png 768w, https://static.hertz-audio.com/media/2021/10/Hertz_AIR.png 1161w" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" />															</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5ce923e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="5ce923e" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p><strong>500 W continuous power handling</strong> is an incredible result for such a compact subwoofer. To accomplish this ambitious goal, the <strong>Hertz R&amp;D</strong> has developed the proprietary <strong>AIR (Air Intercooling Revolution)</strong> technology, optimizing the fluid dynamics of the inner acoustic structure and the magnetic group to <strong>minimize the internal compression of air and maximize cooling capacity</strong>. The <strong>6 layers</strong>, 1.5 in. (38 mm) voice-coil with cooling openings on the former <strong>contributes to the</strong> <strong>thermal stability of the subwoofer</strong>, making MPS subs ready to face to most demanding high-spl listening session.</p>								</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</div>
				<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-078a28f" data-id="078a28f" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f8dd6bc elementor-hidden-desktop elementor-hidden-tablet elementor-hidden-mobile elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="f8dd6bc" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
												<figure class="wp-caption">
											<a href="https://static.hertz-audio.com/media/2021/10/MPS250_VISTA-LATERALE_SPACCATO-ok-AIR.jpg" data-elementor-open-lightbox="yes" data-elementor-lightbox-title="MPS250_VISTA-LATERALE_SPACCATO-ok-AIR" data-e-action-hash="#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6IjY3MzUiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczpcL1wvc3RhdGljLmhlcnR6LWF1ZGlvLmNvbVwvbWVkaWFcLzIwMjFcLzEwXC9NUFMyNTBfVklTVEEtTEFURVJBTEVfU1BBQ0NBVE8tb2stQUlSLmpwZyJ9">
