				<section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-0bc6259 container elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-invisible" data-id="0bc6259" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section" data-settings="{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;slideInLeft&quot;}">
						<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default">
					<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-94e6a6e" data-id="94e6a6e" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8b72882 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="8b72882" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
												<figure class="wp-caption">
											<a href="https://static.hertz-audio.com/media/2021/09/FEM.jpg" data-elementor-open-lightbox="yes" data-elementor-lightbox-title="FEM" data-e-action-hash="#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6IjYxMDgiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczpcL1wvc3RhdGljLmhlcnR6LWF1ZGlvLmNvbVwvbWVkaWFcLzIwMjFcLzA5XC9GRU0uanBnIn0%3D">
							<img width="768" height="432" src="https://static.hertz-audio.com/media/2021/09/FEM-768x432.jpg" class="attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-image-6108" alt="" srcset="https://static.hertz-audio.com/media/2021/09/FEM-768x432.jpg 768w, https://static.hertz-audio.com/media/2021/09/FEM-300x169.jpg 300w, https://static.hertz-audio.com/media/2021/09/FEM.jpg 1024w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" />								</a>
											<figcaption class="widget-image-caption wp-caption-text"></figcaption>
										</figure>
									</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</div>
				<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-13684c1" data-id="13684c1" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e4e87e8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="e4e87e8" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>The design of the magnetic unit has been FEM simulated to <strong>maximize force factor (BxL) symmetry</strong> and thus obtain an optimal linearity even at high excursions, perfectly controlling the inductance modulation.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4cff8c3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="4cff8c3" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Pole piece geometry has been optimized using a breakthrough simulation model that allowed <strong>improving unit force factor</strong>.</p><p>Hertz R&amp;D also focused on <strong>modeling the cone/enclosure behavior</strong>: inside a sealed box, air behaves like a spring &#8211; a non-linear suspension &#8211; whose effect must be compensated to obtain a system as linear as possible at high excursions.</p>								</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</div>
					</div>
		</section>
				<section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-718b07d container elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-invisible" data-id="718b07d" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section" data-settings="{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;slideInRight&quot;}">
						<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default">
					<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-3cd8ffb" data-id="3cd8ffb" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-dd1975a elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="dd1975a" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Model lineup</h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-37eea26 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="37eea26" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>The lineup includes two sizes, 10 and 12 in., each one <strong>available in 2Ω or 4Ω</strong> voice coils configuration, removing all barriers to creativity with custom installations.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f566d4a elementor-align-left no-print elementor-widget elementor-widget-button" data-id="f566d4a" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="button.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<div class="elementor-button-wrapper">
					<a class="elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm" href="https://hertz-audio.com/collections/car-audio-subwoofers-mille/">
