				<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-2ea0016" data-id="2ea0016" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-cbaa5ce elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="cbaa5ce" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Mille PRO Shallow Subwoofer Boxes</h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7660439 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="7660439" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Mille PRO ultra-shallow sealed enclosure are <strong>specifically optimized to deliver all the MPS subwoofer performances</strong> providing breathtaking low frequency from a <strong>box that is only 160 mm (6.3 in.) deep for MPBX 250 S2 and 175 mm (6.89) for MPBX 300 S2. </strong></p>								</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</div>
					</div>
		</section>
				<section class="elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-b12de9e elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-invisible" data-id="b12de9e" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section" data-settings="{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;slideInUp&quot;}">
