				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9a8f022 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="9a8f022" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>They are the Ideal choice <strong>to be installed under the rear bench of pickup</strong> trucks and generally where the space &#8211; and the height &#8211; are limited.</p>								</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</div>
