				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c9f493b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="c9f493b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p><strong>Hertz R&amp;D department meticulously design</strong> the perfect sealed enclosure for MPS 250 S2 and MPS 300 S2 shallow-subwoofer using the most advanced technologies and massive in-car listening sessions to fine-tune the sound.</p>								</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</div>
					</div>
		</section>
				<section class="elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-e6b74cd elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-invisible" data-id="e6b74cd" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section" data-settings="{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;slideInRight&quot;}">
