				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
															<img src="https://static.hertz-audio.com/media/elementor/thumbs/2S2-puhcn7iprek7n5oq1nkdzfj21h17mwb2432ua1b32k.png" title="2S2" alt="2S2" loading="lazy" />															</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c817f9b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="c817f9b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p><strong>2S² (2 Sides/2 Sounds) </strong>design provides the ability to choose between up-firing install to obtain more punch and definition and down-firing mounting, through supplied feet with Hook-and-loop inserts , to increase the low-frequency extension.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1993802 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="1993802" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
