				<section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-23d1a1c container elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-invisible" data-id="23d1a1c" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section" data-settings="{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;slideInLeft&quot;}">
						<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default">
					<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-bfedea2" data-id="bfedea2" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c5e150b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="c5e150b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Model lineup</h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-217118b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="217118b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p><span class="xr_tl xr_s4">The use of the most sophisticated <strong><span class="xr_s20">FEA (Finite Element Analysis) simulation </span></strong></span><span class="xr_tl xr_s4"><strong><span class="xr_s20">tools </span></strong>allowed the identification of ideal design solutions for the designated </span><span class="xr_tl xr_s4">target: outstanding performance in a compact size. <strong><span class="xr_s20">The lineup includes two </span></strong></span><strong><span class="xr_tl xr_s20">sizes, 10 and 12 in., each one available in 2Ω + 2Ω or 4Ω + 4Ω double voice coils </span></strong><span class="xr_tl xr_s4"><strong><span class="xr_s20">configuration</span></strong>, removing all barriers to creativity with custom installations.</span></p>								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d3d7026 elementor-align-left no-print elementor-widget elementor-widget-button" data-id="d3d7026" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="button.default">
