				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
												<figure class="wp-caption">
											<a href="https://static.hertz-audio.com/media/2021/09/mille-pro-sub-eid.jpg" data-elementor-open-lightbox="yes" data-elementor-lightbox-title="mille-pro-sub-eid" data-e-action-hash="#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6IjYxMDUiLCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczpcL1wvc3RhdGljLmhlcnR6LWF1ZGlvLmNvbVwvbWVkaWFcLzIwMjFcLzA5XC9taWxsZS1wcm8tc3ViLWVpZC5qcGcifQ%3D%3D">
							<img width="768" height="349" src="https://static.hertz-audio.com/media/2021/09/mille-pro-sub-eid-768x349.jpg" class="attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-image-6105" alt="" srcset="https://static.hertz-audio.com/media/2021/09/mille-pro-sub-eid-768x349.jpg 768w, https://static.hertz-audio.com/media/2021/09/mille-pro-sub-eid-300x136.jpg 300w, https://static.hertz-audio.com/media/2021/09/mille-pro-sub-eid.jpg 1023w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" />								</a>
											<figcaption class="widget-image-caption wp-caption-text"></figcaption>
										</figure>
									</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</div>
				<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-b931012" data-id="b931012" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d1df6a3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="d1df6a3" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>eID (Elettromedia Identification) is the exclusive technology providing the <b>traceability of the Mille.3 products from their birth on</b>.</p><p>Once the test phase has been passed, the code linked to destination country/market is applied. When purchasing the product, <b>by scanning the code</b>, the user can check through the web the information about the product and can log into the <b>registration page</b>; by filling it out, the user will be entitled to one additional year of warranty coverage*.</p><p>This way the user will have the certainty of owning a <b>genuine Hertz product</b>, purchased through the official channel.</p><p><em>*in those countries where the agreement with the partner has been made.</em></p>								</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</div>
					</div>
		</section>
